{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"length","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"We have CNF with 12 variables. Clauses list:\n\n1. [5,11]\n2. [-12,10]\n3. [12,8]\n4. [-6,3]\n5. [-1,7]\n6. [-5,2]\n7. [1,4]\n8. [-4,7]\n9. [6,9]\n10. [-11,2]\n11. [-8,10]\n12. [-9,3]\n\nWe need count of satisfying assignments. Let's analyze constraints.\n\nVariables: 1..12.\n\nLet's denote each clause.\n\nC1: v5 OR v11\nC2: ¬v12 OR v10\nC3: v12 OR v8\nC4: ¬v6 OR v3\nC5: ¬v1 OR v7\nC6: ¬v5 OR v2\nC7: v1 OR v4\nC8: ¬v4 OR v7\nC9: v6 OR v9\nC10: ¬v11 OR v2\nC11: ¬v8 OR v10\nC12: ¬v9 OR v3\n\nWe can try to find dependencies.\n\nLet's analyze variable groups.\n\nWe have pairs: (5,11) and (5,2) and (11,2). Actually C6: ¬5 OR 2 => if 5 true then 2 true. C10: ¬11 OR 2 => if 11 true then 2 true. C1: 5 OR 11 => at least one of 5,11 true. So we have: at least one of 5,11 true; if 5 true => 2 true; if 11 true => 2 true. So 2 must be true if either 5 or 11 true. Since at least one of 5,11 true, 2 must be true. So v2 = true forced.\n\nThus v2 true.\n\nNow consider clauses involving 2: only C6 and C10 satisfied by 2 true. Good.\n\nNow variable 1,4,7,5? Let's analyze.\n\nC5: ¬1 OR 7 => if 1 true then 7 true.\nC7: 1 OR 4 => at least one of 1,4 true.\nC8: ¬4 OR 7 => if 4 true then 7 true.\n\nSo we have: 7 must be true if 1 or 4 true. But at least one of 1,4 true. So 7 must be true. Because if 1 true => 7 true; if 4 true => 7 true. So v7 = true forced.\n\nNow with v7 true, C5 satisfied regardless of 1. C8 satisfied regardless of 4. So 1 and 4 free except must satisfy C7: at least one true. So (1,4) cannot both be false. So possibilities: (1=true,4=any), (1=false,4=true). So 2 possibilities.\n\nNow consider variables 6,3,9.\n\nC4: ¬6 OR 3 => if 6 true then 3 true.\nC9: 6 OR 9 => at least one of 6,9 true.\nC12: ¬9 OR 3 => if 9 true then 3 true.\n\nThus if 6 true => 3 true. If 9 true => 3 true. So if either 6 or 9 true, 3 must be true. But at least one of 6,9 true. So 3 must be true. So v3 = true forced.\n\n"}}],"created":1790953924,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":3798,"total_tokens":4566,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-Jyvs63GoxFTZzKKCSGoCNQKd6kxpXSxR","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":3798,"prompt_ms":453.393,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.11937677725118483,"prompt_per_second":8376.838636679437,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2472.732,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.223900912646675,"predicted_per_second":310.18323053205927}}